    "SectionRankingExport": {
      "description": "Per section: what was narrated, and what lost. PRD \u00a76.5 \u2014 \"persist the\nfull ranked list including everything below the cut, that is the only\nsignal that later tells us the presets are wrong.\" Lampiran C renders it.",
